{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2022-08-25 06:30:00', 'title': "MIX TELEMATICS TO ACQUIRE TRIMBLE'S FIELD SERVICE MANAGEMENT BUSINESS", 'text': "BOCA RATON, FLA. , AUG. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MIX TELEMATICS (JSE: MIX) (NYSE: MIXT), A LEADING GLOBAL SAAS PROVIDER OF CONNECTED FLEET MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY HAS SIGNED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE TRIMBLE'S FIELD SERVICE MANAGEMENT'S (FSM) BUSINESS."}